ipedia.org/wiki/Hamne_bint_Cahş\" title=\"Hamne bint Cahş\">Hamne</a></li></ul></div></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Hanedan</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Benî_Haşim\" title=\"Benî Haşim\">Benî Haşim</a> (doğuştan)<br/><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Benî_Esed?action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"Benî Esed (sayfa mevcut değil)\" class=\"new\" typeof=\"mw:LocalizedAttrs\" data-mw-i18n='{\"title\":{\"lang\":\"x-page\",\"key\":\"red-link-title\",\"params\":[\"Benî Esed\"]}}'>Benî Esed</a> (evlilikten)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Babası</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdülmuttalib_bin_Haşim\" title=\"Abdülmuttalib bin Haşim\">Abdülmuttalib bin Haşim</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Annesi</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fatıma_bint_Amr\" title=\"Fatıma bint Amr\">Fatıma bint Amr</a></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p id=\"mwBA\"><b id=\"mwBQ\">Ümeyme bint Abdülmuttalib</b> (<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arapça\" title=\"Arapça\" about=\"#mwt3\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwBg\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Dil\",\"href\":\"./Şablon:Dil\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"ar\"},\"2\":{\"wt\":\"أميمة بنت عبد المطلب\"},\"dil_adı\":{\"wt\":\"e\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'>Arapça</a><span about=\"#mwt3\">:</span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\" about=\"#mwt3\"> </span><span class=\"lang-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"ltr\" about=\"#mwt3\" id=\"mwBw\">أميمة بنت عبد المطلب</span>), <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/İslam\" title=\"İslam\" id=\"mwCA\">İslam</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peygamber\" title=\"Peygamber\" id=\"mwCQ\">peygamberi</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Muhammed\" title=\"Muhammed\" id=\"mwCg\">Muhammed</a>'in halasıdır.<sup about=\"#mwt4\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Saad1_1-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Saad1\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Saad1-1\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Saad1-1\" id=\"mwCw\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDA\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDQ\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDg\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<p id=\"mwDw\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdülmuttalib_bin_Haşim\" title=\"Abdülmuttalib bin Haşim\" id=\"mwEA\">Abdülmuttalib bin Haşim</a> ve <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fatıma_bint_Amr\" title=\"Fatıma bint Amr\" id=\"mwEQ\">Fatıma bint Amr</a>'in son çocukları olarak <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mekke\" title=\"Mekke\" id=\"mwEg\">Mekke</a>'de doğdu.<sup about=\"#mwt5\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Saad1_1-1\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Saad1\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Saad1-1\" id=\"mwEw\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwFA\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFQ\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFg\">]</span></span></a></sup> Peygamberin babası <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdullah_bin_Abdülmuttalib\" title=\"Abdullah bin Abdülmuttalib\" id=\"mwFw\">Abdullah</a> ile Ümeyme anne-baba bir kardeştir. Ümeyme <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Benî_Esed?action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"Benî Esed (sayfa mevcut değil)\" class=\"new\" typeof=\"mw:LocalizedAttrs\" id=\"mwGA\" data-mw-i18n='{\"title\":{\"lang\":\"x-page\",\"key\":\"red-link-title\",\"params\":[\"Benî Esed\"]}}'>Benî Esed</a> kabilesinden <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cahş_bin_Riab?action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"Cahş bin Riab (sayfa mevcut değil)\" class=\"new\" typeof=\"mw:LocalizedAttrs\" id=\"mwGQ\" data-mw-i18n='{\"title\":{\"lang\":\"x-page\",\"key\":\"red-link-title\",\"params\":[\"Cahş bin Riab\"]}}'>Cahş bin Riab</a> ile evlenmiş ve bu evlilikten altı çocuğu olmuştur.<sup about=\"#mwt7\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Ibn_Ishaq_2-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Ibn Ishaq\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Ibn_Ishaq-2\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Ibn_Ishaq-2\" id=\"mwGg\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwGw\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwHA\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwHQ\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt8\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-3\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-3\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-3\" id=\"mwHg\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwHw\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwIA\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwIQ\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<ol id=\"mwIg\"><li id=\"mwIw\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdullah_bin_Cahş\" title=\"Abdullah bin Cahş\" id=\"mwJA\">Abdulllah</a><sup about=\"#mwt9\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-4\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-4\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-4\" id=\"mwJQ\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwJg\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwJw\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwKA\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt10\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-5\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-5\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-5\" id=\"mwKQ\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=