}'><a href=\"#cite_note-21\" id=\"mwdQ\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwdg\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwdw\">[</span>21<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mweA\">]</span></span></a></sup></li>\n<li id=\"mweQ\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hamne_bint_Cahş\" title=\"Hamne bint Cahş\" id=\"mweg\">Hamne</a><sup about=\"#mwt28\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-22\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-22\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-22\" id=\"mwew\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwfA\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwfQ\">[</span>22<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwfg\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt29\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-23\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-23\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-23\" id=\"mwfw\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwgA\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwgQ\">[</span>23<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwgg\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt30\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-24\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-24\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-24\" id=\"mwgw\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwhA\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwhQ\">[</span>24<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwhg\">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ol>\n\n<p id=\"mwhw\">Ümeyme'nin Müslüman olduğu hakkında kesin bir bilgi olmayıp 622'deki <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medine\" title=\"Medine\" id=\"mwiA\">Medine</a>'ye <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hicret\" title=\"Hicret\" id=\"mwiQ\">hicretlerinde</a> çocuklarına eşlik etmedi.<sup about=\"#mwt31\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-25\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-25\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-25\" id=\"mwig\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwiw\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwjA\">[</span>25<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwjQ\">]</span></span></a></sup> 628'de, peygamber ona <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hayber\" title=\"Hayber\" id=\"mwjg\">Hayber</a>'den yıllık 40 veske hurmaya denk maaş verdiğinde hâlâ hayattaydı.<sup about=\"#mwt32\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-26\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-26\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-26\" id=\"mwjw\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwkA\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwkQ\">[</span>26<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwkg\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"1\" id=\"mwkw\" aria-labelledby=\"Kaynakça\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Kaynakça\"><span id=\"Kaynak.C3.A7a\" typeof=\"mw:FallbackId\"></span>Kaynakça</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%C3%9Cmeyme_bint_Abd%C3%BClmuttalib&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Değiştirilen bölüm: Kaynakça\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>değiştir</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%C3%9Cmeyme_bint_Abd%C3%BClmuttalib&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Bölümün kaynak kodunu değiştir: Kaynakça\"><span>kaynağı değiştir</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt33\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwlA\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"kaynakça\",\"href\":\"./Şablon:Kaynakça\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"Templat